# game/events/day1.rpy:5
translate english day1_intro_4c4484b7:

    # "Город N98 не был особенным."
    "City N98 wasn't special."

# game/events/day1.rpy:6
translate english day1_intro_59940398:

    # "Для большинства жителей он был просто домом."
    "For most of its residents, it was simply home."

# game/events/day1.rpy:8
translate english day1_intro_25854ae9:

    # "Здесь редко выбрасывали вещи, которые ещё можно починить."
    "People here rarely threw away things that could still be repaired."

# game/events/day1.rpy:10
translate english day1_intro_e4e5e600:

    # "Новый музыкальный сервис требовал подписку. Новый телевизор — подписку на обновления."
    "A new music service required a subscription. A new TV required a subscription for updates."

# game/events/day1.rpy:12
translate english day1_intro_7bc83e34:

    # "Современные бытовые приборы работали только c оплаченным тарифным планом."
    "Modern household appliances only worked with an active subscription plan."

# game/events/day1.rpy:14
translate english day1_intro_026b4174:

    # "Старому проигрывателю было всё равно. Вставил диск — и слушай музыку."
    "The old music player didn't care. Put in a disc and listen to music."

# game/events/day1.rpy:16
translate english day1_intro_660906ef:

    # "Старому телевизору тоже ничего не было нужно."
    "The old TV didn't need anything either."

# game/events/day1.rpy:18
translate english day1_intro_a0005850:

    # "Докорпоративная техника переходили от родителей к детям."
    "Pre-corporate technology was passed down from parents to children."

# game/events/day1.rpy:20
translate english day1_intro_7fad50e0:

    # "Если вещь ломалась, её часто не выбрасывали."
    "If something broke, people often didn't throw it away."

# game/events/day1.rpy:24
translate english day1_intro_2e790062:

    # "А несли в мастерскую к Квисту. Хопп Квист жил с дочерью в бывшем магазине"
    "Instead, they brought it to Kvist's workshop. Hopp Kvist lived with his daughter in a former shop."

# game/events/day1.rpy:26
translate english day1_intro_2cd40383:

    # "На первом этаже он чинил, а на втором они жили - он справа, а его дочь - слева"
    "He repaired things on the ground floor, while they lived upstairs — he on the right, his daughter on the left."

# game/events/day1.rpy:28
translate english day1_intro_15a5ffb9:

    # "Он каждый день балансировал между заказами, выживанием и человечностью"
    "Every day, he balanced orders, survival, and humanity."

# game/events/day1.rpy:34
translate english day1_intro_7a081d9b:

    # k "Очередной день. Что у нас тут?"
    k "Another day. Let's see what we've got."

# game/events/day1.rpy:36
translate english day1_intro_ad213ac2:

    # k "Один провод, одна микросхема... на ремонт хватит."
    k "One wire, one microchip... that's enough for a repair."

# game/events/day1.rpy:38
translate english day1_intro_ae012977:

    # k "На сегодня должно хватить. Хм, 12 кредитов - надо поэкономить."
    k "That should be enough for today. Hmm, twelve credits... I'd better save some money."

# game/events/day1.rpy:40
translate english day1_intro_b6f3fdbc:

    # k "И ещё Нонни просила посмотреть свой аппарат. Старое диагностическое устройство постоянно ломается"
    k "And Nonni asked me to take a look at her device. That old diagnostic unit keeps breaking down."

# game/events/day1.rpy:42
translate english day1_intro_a129abb4:

    # k "Придётся разбирать всё питание... Нонни хорошая женщина"
    k "I'll have to take apart the entire power system... Nonni's a good woman."

# game/events/day1.rpy:44
translate english day1_intro_15d7748a:

    # k "Ладно. Сначала посмотрим, может еще кто что принесет сегодня"
    k "All right. Let's see if anyone else brings something in today."

# game/events/day1.rpy:52
translate english day1_andrea_call_a575b16d:

    # a "Привет, па. Еду от Даров Моря."
    a "Hi, Dad. I'm on my way from Sea Gifts."

# game/events/day1.rpy:53
translate english day1_andrea_call_fe708c6c:

    # k "Как погода?"
    k "How's the weather?"

# game/events/day1.rpy:54
translate english day1_andrea_call_ffeb1ff8:

    # a "Ты шутишь? Дерьмо, как обычно! И моноколесо опять скрипит - достало!"
    a "Are you kidding? Shitty as usual! And my monowheel is squeaking again — I'm so sick of it!"

# game/events/day1.rpy:55
translate english day1_andrea_call_6aa28f45:

    # k "Подкопим, купим детали, отремонтируем, все будет хорошо"
    k "We'll save up, buy the parts, fix it, and everything will be fine."

# game/events/day1.rpy:56
translate english day1_andrea_call_2181d91f:

    # a "Да знаю я."
    a "Yeah, I know."

# game/events/day1.rpy:62
translate english day1_linchi_visit_c2afaa36:

    # "Через несколько минут в дверь стучат."
    "A few minutes later, someone knocks on the door."

# game/events/day1.rpy:64
translate english day1_linchi_visit_e1fd4738:

    # l "Добрый день, Квист."
    l "Good afternoon, Kvist."

# game/events/day1.rpy:65
translate english day1_linchi_visit_1e8d5200:

    # k "Здравствуйте, бабуля Линь."
    k "Hello, Grandma Lin."

# game/events/day1.rpy:67
translate english day1_linchi_visit_5406be25:

    # "Линь Чи достает старый плеер."
    "Linh Chi takes out an old music player."

# game/events/day1.rpy:69
translate english day1_linchi_visit_2d5a2789:

    # "Добавлен новый заказ: [tr('linh', 'name')] - [tr('linh', 'order_name')]"
    "New order added: [tr('linh', 'name')] - [tr('linh', 'order_name')]"

# game/events/day1.rpy:71
translate english day1_linchi_visit_20c0f053:

    # l "Посмотришь?"
    l "Could you take a look at it?"

# game/events/day1.rpy:72
translate english day1_linchi_visit_6584a78f:

    # k "Что случилось?"
    k "What happened?"

# game/events/day1.rpy:73
translate english day1_linchi_visit_5d9dfed6:

    # l "Внук уронил."
    l "My grandson dropped it."

# game/events/day1.rpy:74
translate english day1_linchi_visit_9aea3a90:

    # k "Хм"
    k "Hmm."

# game/events/day1.rpy:75
translate english day1_linchi_visit_047e9299:

    # l "В старом зоопарке."
    l "At the old zoo."

# game/events/day1.rpy:76
translate english day1_linchi_visit_f8b20649:

    # k "Там же всё закрыто."
    k "But that place is closed."

# game/events/day1.rpy:77
translate english day1_linchi_visit_1695d1c9:

    # l "Потому и полез. Упал в медвежий вольер."
    l "That's why he went in. He fell into the bear enclosure."

# game/events/day1.rpy:78
translate english day1_linchi_visit_b198bac0:

    # k "И как он?"
    k "And how is he?"

# game/events/day1.rpy:79
translate english day1_linchi_visit_4e687a93:

    # l "Не знаю. Я его там не видела."
    l "I don't know. I didn't see him there."

# game/events/day1.rpy:81
translate english day1_linchi_visit_6c0632e2:

    # l "Плеер нужен поскорее. Без музыки грустно."
    l "I need the player back as soon as possible. It's sad without music."

# game/events/day1.rpy:82
translate english day1_linchi_visit_971b203b:

    # "Линь Чи уходит."
    "Linh Chi leaves."

# game/events/day1.rpy:89
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_db55f4ef:

    # "Опять стучат, но уже знакомо."
    "Another knock, but this time a familiar one."

# game/events/day1.rpy:91
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_465f78b3:

    # a "Я дома."
    a "I'm home."

# game/events/day1.rpy:92
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_df3d50dd:

    # k "Вижу."
    k "I can see that."

# game/events/day1.rpy:93
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_b634c0a2:

    # a "По дороге опять смотрела на новые магнитные самокаты."
    a "On the way home, I was looking at those new magnetic scooters again."

# game/events/day1.rpy:94
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_b11dfdcf:

    # k "И опять решила, что они тебе нужны?"
    k "And you decided again that you need one?"

# game/events/day1.rpy:95
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_c1be3f4b:

    # a "Нужны."
    a "I do."

# game/events/day1.rpy:96
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_02665ceb:

    # a "Но не настолько, чтобы платить за них каждый месяц."
    a "But not enough to pay for one every month."

# game/events/day1.rpy:97
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_a3ac3ed7:

    # k "Вот и молодец."
    k "Good."

# game/events/day1.rpy:98
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_2d66dac5:

    # a "Не начинай."
    a "Don't start."

# game/events/day1.rpy:99
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_110c08e4:

    # a "Я люблю своё колесо."
    a "I love my wheel."

# game/events/day1.rpy:100
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_78ec16bb:

    # a "Оно старое, страшное и скрипит."
    a "It's old, ugly, and squeaks."

# game/events/day1.rpy:101
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_ffb1a304:

    # a "Зато не требует подписку на право поворачивать налево."
    a "But at least it doesn't require a subscription for the right to turn left."

# game/events/day1.rpy:102
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_2473d4f2:

    # k "Пока что."
    k "For now."

# game/events/day1.rpy:103
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_6c5086ea:

    # a "Не подсказывай им идеи."
    a "Don't give them any ideas."

# game/events/day1.rpy:104
translate english day1_andrea_arrives_5ad13c78:

    # k "Постараюсь."
    k "I'll try."